  "question": {
    "text": "<p>Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mfenced><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mo> </mo><mi>B</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mo> </mo><mi>C</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>β</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>D</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>δ</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> be the vertices of a parallelogram <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi></math>. If the point <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>C</mi></math> lies on <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></math> and the point <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>D</mi></math> lies on <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn></math>, then the value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>β</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>γ</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>δ</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> is equal to ______.</p>",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "32",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mfenced><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mo> </mo><mi>B</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mo> </mo><mi>C</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>β</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>D</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>δ</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> be the vertices of a parallelogram <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi></math></p><p>And the point <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>C</mi></math> lies on <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></math> and the point <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>D</mi></math> lies on <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn></math>,</p><p>Now, plotting the diagram we get,</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/e02fb1ae-397d-4a05-86bf-e81c7447ae83.png\" style=\"width: 500px; height: 257px;\"/></p><p>Now, using the midpoint formula we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mo>≡</mo><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>β</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>≡</mo><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mi>δ</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Now, on comparing we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>β</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>δ</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>α</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>γ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo> </mo><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>,</mo><mo> </mo><mi>β</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>δ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo> </mo><mo>(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>)</mo></math></p><p>Also, given <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>δ</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> lies on <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>γ</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>δ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>3</mn></mfenced></math></p><p>And <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>β</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> lies on <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>α</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>β</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>)</mo></math></p><p>On solving equations <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>,</mo><mo> </mo><mo>(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>,</mo><mo> </mo><mo>(</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>,</mo><mo> </mo><mo>(</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>)</mo></math> we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>α</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mo> </mo><mi>β</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>11</mn><mo>,</mo><mo> </mo><mi>γ</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>,</mo><mo> </mo><mi>δ</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>12</mn></math></p><p>Hence, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>β</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>γ</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>δ</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>11</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>12</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>32</mn></math></p>",
    "image": null
  },
